   "resumo_en": "From the Underground and Below is the ninth studio album by thrash metal band Overkill, released in 1997 by CMC International. Two cover songs were recorded during these sessions: \"No Feelings\" by Sex Pistols and \"Space Truckin'\" by Deep Purple. Lead singer Bobby \"Blitz\" Ellsworth considers From the Underground and Below to be one of his favorite Overkill albums.\nThe album was re-issued along with Necroshine (1999) as part of a box set in 2003.",
